I think I fixed it- 4KB more stack, 256KB more heap, and shoved
the secondary load address down 8KB.

This fixes this for now. Definitely a candidate for some rework. I tried some
fun and games using the boot1 area (which gets freed anyway) as a stack zone,
but that didn't work real well- mostly I just wanted to get this fixed for
now.


